  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aquasystems Farm Irrigation and Watering Solar System in Awdhegle Wells</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will work for Solar water pump installation. They will engage solar companies to assess the required type of solar, quantity, and quality. Install the solar water pump irrigation systems for farming and watering. They will also construct Water Tanks. All of this will decrease fuel costs for the farm production and increase company revenue.</narrative>
